40
00:02:11.483 --> 00:02:32.010
Ms. Lily asks the class some questions. Have you ever been abroad? Dara has flown in a plane to Thailand. Lina has seen snow in Japan! Vibol has ridden a horse and climbed a mountain. Malis has eaten insects at the market: crunchy! Has anyone met a famous person? Not yet! But Malis has won a prize for her drawing.

